  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with transformer aggregation and weighted fusion (e.g., config_039) achieve high performance. This experiment tests whether replacing the RNA encoder from scvi_n200 (used in config_039) with scgpt, while keeping the image encoder (imagenet_vit_l), aggregation (transformer), and fusion (weighted) unchanged, can further improve accuracy. This isolates the effect of the RNA encoder choice, a critical design decision, and leverages the strong prior evidence for transformer/weighted configurations."
}

